{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Dw0uHCP15B1794964273.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>APEC工商領導人峰會今日繼續在前海舉行。</p><p></p><p>峰會在前海國際會議中心舉行。早上七時許， 會場附近大部分路段仍然圍封，安保加強，有交通警用鐵閘圍封路口。載著與會嘉賓的旅遊巴約八時半陸續抵達。峰會一連兩天舉行，逾2,000名來自21個經濟體的政商界領袖參與。</p><p></p><p>另外，APEC領導人非正式會議今日亦會在深圳國際會議交流中心舉行。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T02:03:48.103484+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":160,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T01:12:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T07:00:36.078097+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T01:57:10.156254+00:00","content_hash":"c8699a5345a10a6774fed6304843a36d53b0d4abcab354f60148a963653a5eda","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T02:03:48.103484+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}